THE INSIDE-OUT INVERSION}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\qc\sb0\sa60{\rtlch\af7\afs26\ai \ltrch\loch\cf23\fs26\i\dbch\af7\loch
The Canonical Layer Transition Mechanism}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\qc\sb0\sa180{\rtlch\af7\afs20\ai \ltrch\loch\cf24\fs20\i\dbch\af7\loch
Unifying the Schwarzschild Horizon, Hawking Pairs, Antimatter, the Ptolemy Inversion, Negative Mass, and the Gravinon as special cases of a single algebraic map}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb80\sa80\brdrt\brdrnone\brdrl\brdrnone\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf26\brsp20\brdrr\brdrnone\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa120\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb300\sa120{\rtlch\af7\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs32\b\dbch\af7\loch
Abstract}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
We define the Inside-Out Inversion \uc0 \u55349\uc1 \u56485\'3f_N as the canonical map at every layer transition boundary in the Ainulindal\u235\'eb framework. The map exchanges the radial (iterative) and angular (directional) polar coordinates while preserving the action integral. It produces conjugate state pairs \u8212\'97 the algebraic origin of particle-antiparticle creation, Hawking radiation, and negative energy states. The fixed point of the map at r = 1 defines the zero-mass state we identify as the Gravinon, consistent with the independently derived equation \u936\'3f_G = Res(f, \u966\'3f). Four previously unrelated phenomena in established physics \u8212\'97 the Schwarzschild coordinate exchange, Hawking pair production, the Dirac sea, and the Ptolemy inversion of the Riemann zeta curve \u8212\'97 are shown to be special cases of \uc0 \u55349\uc1 \u56485\'3f_N at different recursion depths. Negative mass and negative energy are defined without exotic postulates as the inversion-conjugate states of ordinary mass and energy seen across a layer boundary.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb80\sa80\brdrt\brdrnone\brdrl\brdrnone\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf26\brsp20\brdrr\brdrnone\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb300\sa120{\rtlch\af7\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs32\b\dbch\af7\loch
\u167\'a70 \u8212\'97 Intuitive Statement}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
At a layer transition boundary, the quantity that was the radial coordinate becomes the angular coordinate, and the quantity that was the angular coordinate becomes the radial coordinate. The geometric effect \u8212\'97 the physics \u8212\'97 is preserved. The physical interpretation of which quantity is 'inside' and which is 'outside' is exchanged.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
This is not a coordinate transformation in the usual sense. It is a change in which degree of freedom carries the recursion and which carries the direction. The recursion factor increments. The old iteration becomes the new direction. The old direction becomes the new iteration.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb80\sa80\brdrt\brdrnone\brdrl\brdrnone\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf26\brsp20\brdrr\brdrnone\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb300\sa120{\rtlch\af7\afs32\ab \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs32\b\dbch\af7\loch
