\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
r_N \u8212\'97 the radial coordinate: the iteration count at depth N. How many recursive steps have been accumulated. The magnitude of the state.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
\u952\'3f_N \u8212\'97 the angular coordinate: the direction of the next iteration. The orientation of the current state transition relative to the reference frame.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa60\loch

\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80{\rtlch\af7\afs20 \ltrch\loch\cf17\fs20\dbch\af7\loch
The pair (r_N, \u952\'3f_N) is the unique decomposition of the state into its iterative content and its directional content. These are the two primitives established in the foundational ontology of this framework. All other physical quantities are derived from them.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs20\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af4\loch\ql\widctlpar\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa0\ltrpar\cf17\f4\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sb0\sa80\loch

